The PW.3 having deposed to the aforesaid effect again in his further evidence has deposed that, since deceased was diabetic patient,
if he had taken proper follow up treatment he would not have succumbed to the injuries and that after the discharge of deceased from their hospital if deceased had taken any follow up treatment,
then the follow up treatment given by the Medical Officer is the competent person to speak about the cause for death.
